## Complete Field Reference

### Core Fields

#### name (required)

**Type**: String
**Format**: kebab-case
**Example**: `"test-automation-suite"`

The unique identifier for the plugin. Used for:
- Plugin identification in Claude Code
- Conflict detection with other plugins
