BUDGET: you have at most ~15 tool calls. Spend them reading the changed files first, then 3-5 targeted Greps for callers/sinks. Do NOT exhaustively explore the repo â€” once you can name sourceâ†’sink for each candidate (or rule it out), STOP. Partial findings are better than none."""


